!debug.keystore
# 2026-06-06: per-project debug keystore (RSA, self-signed, 10000-day
# validity, password "marketanalysisdebug"). Debug-only key, no
# production secrets. Committed so its SHA-1 (033f2e7d…) — already
# registered with Firebase — is what every contributor signs debug
# builds with, enabling Google Sign-In on debug without depending on
# the global ~/.android/debug.keystore. See docs/CHANGELOG.md Bug 2.
!marketanalysis-debug.keystore

